What each error says:
  terse        Error: invalid metric.
  instructive  Error: unknown metric 'sales'. Valid metrics are: revenue, gross_profit, margin_pct, orders, uni
  terse        Error: invalid region.
  instructive  Error: unknown region 'midwest'. Did you mean 'Midwest'? Region names are capitalised.

A tool error is not a log line. It is the next thing the model reads, and it is
the only chance to say what a valid call looks like.

Name the valid values. Suggest the correction. Say what to retry with. It costs
a few tokens once and saves a round trip every time it fires.
